{{define "body"}}<tr>
  <td class="email-pad" style="padding:38px 44px 38px;">
    <h1 class="email-title" style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#101727;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;">{{if .ZH}}{{.V.OwnerName}} 与你共享了 {{.V.Label}}{{else}}{{.V.OwnerName}} shared {{.V.Label}} with you{{end}}</h1>
    <p style="margin:0 0 22px;color:#101727;font-size:17px;line-height:30px;">{{if .ZH}}你现在可以在 {{.App}} 中为这个账户生成验证码。{{else}}You can now generate codes for this account in {{.App}}.{{end}}</p>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f3f5f9" style="background:#f3f5f9;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 22px;"><tr>
      <td style="padding:18px 22px;word-break:break-word;">
        <div style="color:#101727;font-size:20px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;">{{.V.Label}}</div>
        {{if .V.Account}}<div style="color:#101727;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;">{{.V.Account}}</div>{{end}}
      </td>
    </tr></table>
    <p style="margin:0 0 26px;color:#101727;font-size:16px;line-height:28px;">{{if .ZH}}共享只包含生成验证码的权限，你看不到也无法导出它的密钥。所有者可以随时取消共享，每次生成验证码都会记录在日志中。{{else}}Sharing only lets you generate codes: you cannot see or export the secret. The owner can stop sharing at any time, and each generated code is logged.{{end}}</p>
    {{if .ZH}}{{template "button" (btn .V.AppURL "打开账户列表")}}{{else}}{{template "button" (btn .V.AppURL "Open my accounts")}}{{end}}
  </td>
</tr>{{end}}
